  44:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   ==============================================================================
  45:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****                       ##### TIMER Generic features #####
  46:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   ==============================================================================
  47:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..] The Timer features include:
  48:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        (#) 16-bit up, down, up/down auto-reload counter.
  49:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        (#) 16-bit programmable prescaler allowing dividing (also on the fly) the
  50:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            counter clock frequency either by any factor between 1 and 65536.
  51:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        (#) Up to 4 independent channels for:
  52:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) Input Capture
  53:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) Output Compare
  54:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) PWM generation (Edge and Center-aligned Mode)
  55:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) One-pulse mode output
  56:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        (#) Synchronization circuit to control the timer with external signals and to interconnect
  57:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****             several timers together.
  58:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        (#) Supports incremental encoder for positioning purposes
  59:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
  60:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****             ##### How to use this driver #####
  61:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   ==============================================================================
  62:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****     [..]
  63:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****      (#) Initialize the TIM low level resources by implementing the following functions
  64:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****          depending on the selected feature:
  65:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) Time Base : HAL_TIM_Base_MspInit()
  66:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) Input Capture : HAL_TIM_IC_MspInit()
  67:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) Output Compare : HAL_TIM_OC_MspInit()
  68:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) PWM generation : HAL_TIM_PWM_MspInit()
  69:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) One-pulse mode output : HAL_TIM_OnePulse_MspInit()
  70:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****            (++) Encoder mode output : HAL_TIM_Encoder_MspInit()
  71:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
  72:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****      (#) Initialize the TIM low level resources :
  73:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****         (##) Enable the TIM interface clock using __HAL_RCC_TIMx_CLK_ENABLE();
  74:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****         (##) TIM pins configuration
  75:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the TIM GPIOs using the following function:
  76:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****              __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE();
  77:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****             (+++) Configure these TIM pins in Alternate function mode using HAL_GPIO_Init();
  78:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
  79:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****      (#) The external Clock can be configured, if needed (the default clock is the
  80:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****          internal clock from the APBx), using the following function:
  81:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****          HAL_TIM_ConfigClockSource, the clock configuration should be done before
  82:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****          any start function.
  83:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
  84:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****      (#) Configure the TIM in the desired functioning mode using one of the
  85:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        Initialization function of this driver:
  86:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        (++) HAL_TIM_Base_Init: to use the Timer to generate a simple time base
  87:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****        (++) HAL_TIM_OC_Init and HAL_TIM_OC_ConfigChannel: to use the Timer to generate an
