 111:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 112:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 113:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   The compilation define  USE_HAL_TIM_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 114:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 115:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 116:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 117:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   Use Function HAL_TIM_RegisterCallback() to register a callback.
 118:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   HAL_TIM_RegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 119:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   the Callback ID and a pointer to the user callback function.
 120:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 121:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 122:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   Use function HAL_TIM_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 123:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   weak function.
 124:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   HAL_TIM_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 125:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   and the Callback ID.
 126:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c **** 
 127:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   [..]
 128:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****   These functions allow to register/unregister following callbacks:
 129:Drivers/STM32F4/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_tim.c ****     (+) Base_MspInitCallback              : TIM Base Msp Init Callback.
